{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T21:39:48.920Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"436e44ca2d204a1ee603915a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1655","claim:pm-mrvq8u","claim:pm-thbdxu","lineage:pm-thbdxu","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1655+pm-mrvq8u+pm-thbdxu","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1655","claim:pm-mrvq8u","claim:pm-thbdxu","lineage:pm-thbdxu","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.317","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T21:39:48.920Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-03T21:39:48.919Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implemented. (1) Caller vocabulary: core/item/literal-mutation-input.ts gains MutationInputAudience, mutationInputAudience (literal-marked typed SDK/MCP input is 'sdk', a CLI adapter's bag is 'cli'), mutationOptionLabel, sdkClearRemedy and emptyMutationOptionMessage. normalizeParentReferenceValue, validateMissingParentReference, assertParentReferenceIsNotSelf and validateSprintOrReleaseValue take an optional audience (default 'cli', so the public advanced exports keep their wording); create/update pass it, and update's empty assignee/closeReason refusals use it. SDK wording: parent must not be the placeholder \"none\". Pass unset: [\"parent\"] or null to clear it, or omit parent. (2) Null clears: foldNullClearsIntoUnset (sdk/lifecycle/shared-unset-fields.ts) rewrites a typed null on any option the command's unset list covers into its unset token, in both client dispatch (runtime-input normalizedActionOptions) and direct domain calls (prepareNativeMutationOptions). author is excluded (attribution, not a stored field) and keeps its by-name refusal, as do non-clearable fields like title. CREATE_/UPDATE_UNSET_FIELD_DEFINITIONS moved into shared-unset-fields.ts so the fold and both commands share one table (also frees update.ts headroom under the 3400 implementation-line cap). (3) Advisory: literalSentinelAdvisories emits literal_sentinel_stored:<field>:<value> when typed input stores none/null/- in a clearable string field; CLI input never gets it. Probe over 44 fields x 4 tokens (none, -, null, empty) on the rebuilt dist: every parent/sprint/release/assignee/closeReason refusal is SDK-worded; CLI wording verified unchanged in a sandbox (--parent '' / --assignee '' / --sprint '' / --close-reason '' / self parent / strict missing parent)."}]}],"before_hash":"ce12a1c6c4df8b578caa169bdc75edccf37ab57a45f61f2a275847d68335fdb3","after_hash":"ad0fdef025ad19ed355846c9eab6646b5483e66c1815d5d7b422a7553a1e13b3","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"09d10caa67977b08a37fceb7fbfb41e85d1f1eb80053b0a35b735b06f77ea3a8"}
